# Draft theme preview URLs

When pushing an unpublished draft and verifying with agent-browser:

- Do not use `pnpm push:*` (`--allow-live`). Use `shopify theme push -e <env> --unpublished --theme "..." --json`.
- After the `*.myshopify.com?preview_theme_id=` URL redirects to the primary domain, the param is stripped. Immediately re-open the redirected origin + path with `preview_theme_id` restored.
- Repeat after every navigation. Confirm `Shopify.theme.id` matches the draft before measuring.
- Full steps: `.cursor/references/draft-theme-agent-browser.md`.
